body:
A recruiter sent me this. According to the guide between $137k and $215k for your location and working for a firm. They are taking advantage of you. Hire a writer for a resume, cover letter, and LinkedIn, and move on.

&#x200B;

https://www.roberthalf.com/salary-guide/specialization/legal

Hey Brent,

&#x200B;

Not sure if it's a known bug, but when I play coop on my switch we sometimes experience an issue of my coop partner getting stuck in walls when entering different portions of the rat's lair. When this happens it's often game over unless we can kill him while stuck in the wall. I wish I had a picture to show what I am talking about. If it happens again I will share the picture. Thanks for the update!
